# Decision log

After any non-trivial code change, append an entry to `decisions.md` (repo root). Do not skip this because the change “seems obvious.”

Each entry must include:

- Date and session context
- Decision (what was chosen)
- Alternatives considered
- Why this option (library, pattern, or tradeoff)
- What was accepted as a cost
- Files touched

Log these kinds of choices: new dependency vs existing one, pattern (graph vs linear, JWT vs session, live API vs mock), storage, auth/RBAC, retrieval/fusion, error handling, and “leave this mocked for now.”

Do not invent decisions that were not actually made. If you only followed an existing pattern, say so in one line.
